        "TileImage": "$($repository 5fda72e7-34d8-4449-89eb-79ab705091ae).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon 47, recently the Delgado drug cartel has been shipping tampered substances. The tampered ingrediant appears to be untracable but incrediably deadly, because of this Rico Delgado has hired us to quietly remove the culprits. Our analysts have discovered the substance and who made it. Even knowing what it is does not help us trace it. Delgado is preparing for a shipment in the millions, if the batch that gets shipped is tampered millions will die. I will leave you to prepare 47.",
